de_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-01-22T04:57:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-07T15:57:15Z","closed_at":"2026-05-07T15:34:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115216.\r\n\r\nMy understanding is: for projects with low `reflections/sky_reflections/roughness_layers`, not enough mipmaps are available to generate multiple layers of lighting reflections. This change prevents attempting to generate additional lighting layers when the layer count has surpassed the mipmap count.\r\n\r\nAfter confirming this bug locally and applying this fix, I confirmed it seems to work on the surface. Would appreciate some extra eyes!\r\n\r\nI was able to confirm + fix this in Forward+, but I was not able to reproduce in Mobile.\r\n\r\nBased on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104302, I also wonder if this should show a warning somewhere? \r\n\r\nRecording of it working:\r\n[Screencast_20260121_235020.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d773c46-bb8f-4488-8605-86a1ef9a6fec)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"xhocquet","id":81